    <bpmn:serviceTask camunda:asyncAfter="true" camunda:asyncBefore="true" camunda:expression="${true}" completionQuantity="1" id="VersturenNotificatieNaarKlachtenteamDienstTask" implementation="##WebService" isForCompensation="false" name="Versturen notificatie naar klachtenteam dienst" startQuantity="1">
                  
      
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
                        
        
        <camunda:inputOutput>
                              
          
          <camunda:inputParameter name="zaaknummer">${valueResolverDelegateService.resolveValue(execution, "zaak:identificatie")}</camunda:inputParameter>
                              
          
          <camunda:inputParameter name="berichtNaarKlachtenteam">${documentDelegateService.findValueByJsonPointerOrDefault("/eersteBeoordeling/berichtNaarKlachtenteamDienst",execution,"")}</camunda:inputParameter>
                              
          
          <camunda:outputParameter name="resultaat">${valueResolverDelegateService.handleValue(execution, "doc:/eersteBeoordeling/resultaat", "")}</camunda:outputParameter>
                            
        
        </camunda:inputOutput>
                        
        
        <camunda:properties>
                              
          
          <camunda:property name="mailSendTaskFrom" value="noreply@valtomi.nl"/>
                              
          
          <camunda:property name="mailSendTaskTemplate" value="klachtenproces-notificatie-nieuw-klachtenteam-toegewezen"/>
                              
          
          <camunda:property name="mailSendTaskSubject" value="Melding klacht doorgestuurd naar andere dienst"/>
                              
          
          <camunda:property name="mailSendTaskTo" value="${emailDienst}"/>
                            
        
        </camunda:properties>
                      
      
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
                  
      
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_0dfdv26</bpmn:incoming>
                  
      
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_00s5ihj</bpmn:outgoing>
                
    
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
            
    
